  - [Operating Systems](#operating-systems)
  - [Requirements](#requirements)
  - [Building](#building)
- [Usage](#usage)
  - [Algorithm](#algorithm)
  - [Recreating Figures and Tables](#recreating-figures-and-tables)
    - [Figure 1](#figure-1)
    - [Figure/Table 2](#figuretable-2)
      - [Trace Generation](#trace-generation)
